{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f9d66c679349e923","name":"Sabé","source":{"id":"source:reference-f9d66c679349e923","title":"Sabé","revision":19568,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:12:20Z","sha256":"27f358768e639da032321c338f5d973b93f4d6204b0497d3b75a57bacfa94029","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19568","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sab%C3%A9&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f9d66c679349e923","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Naboo Resistance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Naboo_Resistance","referenceId":"reference:3b298416f94cfef7"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["House Organa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/House_Organa","referenceId":"reference:7b8325e7616f3732"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The former handmaiden and bodyguard for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Padmé Amidala"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Padm%C3%A9_Amidala","referenceId":"reference:9ec3198cc43d2391"}," pursues a similar career after ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", working as a diplomatic agent for Naboo's rulers and a clandestine operative for the resistance movement among various Imperial Senators and insurgent groups.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["After ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", Sabé continues her service to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," government as an aid to its representation to the Imperial Senate. Angered by what little she knew of her friend Padmé's death, Sabé identifies and cultivates contacts in the Senate and on sympathetic worlds who secretly opposed Palpatine's tyrannical rule and the Empire's oppressive politics. While walking the corridors of the bureaucracy she quietly aids the resistance, relaying messages between agents, gathering, analyzing, and disseminating intelligence, guarding against Imperial treachery, and counseling those who are seeking to channel aid to freedom fighters around the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a diplomatic emissary, Sabé has official access to transportation, not only between ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"},", but to any worlds that have business, negotiations, or ties with her homeworld. This mobility enables her to expand her secret resistance activities beyond the Senate chamber; she smuggles equipment to nascent cells, conveys intelligence about Imperial operations, and trains freedom fighters in combat and espionage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["During this time, she befriends Senator ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bail Organa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bail_Organa","referenceId":"reference:25959f9d5a1655a3"}," and becomes one of his principal agents carrying out operations behind the scenes. She makes many trips to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Alderaan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Alderaan","referenceId":"reference:c7a6b713a1619ee9"}," to check in on Amidala's daughter, now Organa's adopted daughter, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Leia Organa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Leia_Organa","referenceId":"reference:225034c3501e6ae6"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bail Organa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bail_Organa","referenceId":"reference:25959f9d5a1655a3"}," encourages Sabé to tutor Leia and her close companion ",{"tag":"a","children":["Winter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Winter","referenceId":"reference:1b17869e03ecc1b0"}," in a variety of subjects, from etiquette and bureaucracy to the more esoteric arts. Though Leia learns much from Sabé, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Winter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Winter","referenceId":"reference:1b17869e03ecc1b0"}," spends more time with her, improving skills that later serve her well as Leia's double and bodyguard.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Sabé Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 2/",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +9; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +14\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, Gunganese, Huttese, Ryl, Shyriiwook (understand only)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 20 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-